-- a bijection of a finite model commuting with `x □ y = if a = b then (M.op a a) else if (M.op b b) = a then b else (M.op b a)` is an automorphism of `◇` --
is `GuardAut2_x_y_pyy_x_pxx_y_pyx_Equation3398`, proved elsewhere.  That obligation names no target, so every
